<title>SPAIN: Spain services employment will decline ahead - Rato.</title>
<headline>Spain services employment will decline ahead - Rato.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Friday that employment in the service sector was likely to decline in the autumn and winter.</p>
<p>&quot;We've got to maintain an optimistic attitude but certainly in the next period of autumn and winter employment related to services will fall,&quot; Rato told journalists.</p>
<p>Spain on Friday reported a rise in its jobless rate to 13.82 in September from 13.50 in August.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
